<LegalPage title="Privacy Policy" lede="This page explains what information we collect on this website, why we collect it, and the choices you have. We keep it short and in plain words.">
  <p>Advanced Foot &amp; Ankle Specialists of Arizona ("we", "us") respects your privacy. This policy covers information collected through this website. It does not cover your medical records. Those are protected by HIPAA and described in our <a href="/notice-of-privacy-practices">Notice of Privacy Practices</a>.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Information you give us:</strong> your name, phone number, email and message when you use our contact form, call us, or request an appointment.</li>
    <li><strong>Information collected automatically:</strong> your browser type, device, pages viewed and approximate location (city level), collected through cookies and similar tools if you allow them.</li>
  </ul>
  <p><strong>Please do not send sensitive medical details through the website form.</strong> Contact forms and email are not a secure way to share health information. Call our office instead.</p>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To answer your questions and schedule visits.</li>
    <li>To keep the website secure and working well.</li>
    <li>To understand which pages are useful and improve them (analytics, only with your consent).</li>
    <li>To measure and improve our advertising (marketing cookies, only with your consent).</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>You can accept, reject or customize non-essential cookies using the banner on this site. You can reopen it at any time with the "Cookie settings" link in the footer. Read our <a href="/cookie-policy">Cookie Policy</a> for details.</p>

  <h2>Who we share information with</h2>
  <p>We share information only with service providers that help us run the website, such as hosting, scheduling and analytics providers. They may use it only to provide their service to us. We may also share information when the law requires it, or to protect the safety of our patients and staff.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep website messages only as long as needed to respond and for normal business records. Analytics data is kept for a limited time set by the provider.</p>

  <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
  <p>You may ask us to see, correct or delete personal information we collected through this website. Residents of some states have additional rights under state privacy laws. Call us at <a href="tel:+14809639000">480-963-9000</a> and we will help. Your browser may also let you block cookies.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This website is meant for adults. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13 through the website.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>We use reasonable steps to protect information, but no website or internet transfer is completely secure.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>Our site may link to other websites, such as our online booking page. Their privacy practices are their own.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy. The date at the top shows when it last changed.</p>

